{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "513db5dfb2d3ee089366b03a0942845faa6d2e4a8df0a4be122308476d7aa45e", "ja": "グラビア撮影　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8000_place", "source_sha256": "35bb09306e90018cb3ddef7799b4588fda13f7f4aa9957682b3a26d963ba4f76", "ja": "バーの店内", "zh": "酒吧店内", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8001_p", "source_sha256": "63dca907941ebfcf3bcbefbca7dba92a47feeabebf0866fe2005481ca9aaa00b", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影。\n千鶴さんのテーマは『バーテンダー』だ）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《ViDaVo!》的照片。\n千鹤的主题是“调酒师”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8002_p", "source_sha256": "c74dbd981d79ef05d81c4a8e6a8a532a972fb5d0f548763889b50c71929d44ef", "ja": "うん、やっぱり似合いますね。こういう衣装は、\n千鶴さんのキリッとした雰囲気にピッタリです。", "zh": "嗯，果然很适合您呢。这种服装和千鹤小姐干练的气质非常相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8003_038chz", "source_sha256": "c3af7e0b39abdc7969860b2aa9c224ec8ebd1cfac40de63498193c1798d52e09", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}ったら。少し照れますが\n……そう言っていただけると、自信が持てますわ。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}真是的。虽然有点害羞……\n不过您这么说，我就有自信了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8004_p", "source_sha256": "4896290d570bd6fb0cb32a24216a22afd232905d7d742cd822ffc584d9578960", "ja": "今から本番が楽しみです。\nところで千鶴さんは、バーに行ったことは？", "zh": "我现在就开始期待正式演出了。\n对了，千鹤小姐，你去过酒吧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8005_038chz", "source_sha256": "203e8ae588b5f370c3cc26355a749271fcc4215860f823f22be18314a92c3995", "ja": "そうですわね。大学の友達と飲みに行くことは\nありますけど、バーのようなお店はあんまり……。", "zh": "是这样呢。我确实会和大学朋友一起去喝酒，不过像酒吧这样的店，去得不太多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8006_038chz", "source_sha256": "774593b08e366ef29299c1bff666a147e20ec6125635f444eeae4d6e4ced3d27", "ja": "ですから、バーでの所作やマナーは、\n詳しくありませんの。お恥ずかしい限りですわ……。", "zh": "所以，我不太了解在酒吧里的举止和礼仪。真是让人不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8007_038chz", "source_sha256": "6a4a0466a8014e3994db965442fac251668e2ce7f9ea7814f73885642197faca", "ja": "{$P$}は大人ですから、\nきっとバーにも詳しいのでしょうね？", "zh": "{$P$}是成年人，\n肯定对酒吧也很熟悉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8008", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8009", "source_sha256": "dfe6ec96574916c0202336f490e4af610e8c935d567b631d7337a44a5d48137b", "ja": "居酒屋派", "zh": "居酒屋派", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8010", "source_sha256": "4b878539b612fb9aee0545190eeb80da12c2ac77318abd8851ddc5199a9c3d7d", "ja": "えっと……", "zh": "那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8100_038chz", "source_sha256": "df1f81ac556f60263f134baf2f93aab278f8c8d9da872c6f0e9ed0c49c9bef2c", "ja": "さすがですわ！　それでは早速、\nバーのいろはについて、レクチャーをお願いしますわ。", "zh": "不愧是您！那么就请您马上为我讲解一下酒吧的入门知识吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8101_p", "source_sha256": "d6c345b0e9093aad2581a9a2c731a1a5694b5e10c781eb94ddb05a1c9696c9f8", "ja": "はい。わかる範囲でなら、なんでも。\nどんなことが知りたいですか？", "zh": "好的，只要是我了解的范围内，什么都可以。\n您想了解哪些方面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8102_038chz", "source_sha256": "0298ed14efc03c02bf87870f25f037f7a52e93b11331be15320c5d49f5c69fd0", "ja": "例えば、スマートなお酒の頼み方とか、NGなマナー\nとか……ううっ、知りたいことが山積みですわ～っ！", "zh": "比如，如何优雅地点酒，还有哪些礼仪是绝对不能犯的……\n呜呜，想了解的东西堆积如山呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8200_038chz", "source_sha256": "65d498fa88b25a673672efcdafd01f0dc5d69eb02a53054893cf6031db1a795f", "ja": "まあ！　わたくしも、気持ちがよーくわかりますわ。\nよかったら、今度ご一緒に♪", "zh": "哎呀！我也非常理解你的心情呢。\n可以的话，下次一起去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8201_p", "source_sha256": "f7d205355f14833b85bdbd675d0f343c63e11d8f776d43be15f039ed83c72a89", "ja": "構いませんよ。せっかくですし、\n撮影が終わってからはどうですか？", "zh": "没问题。难得有这个机会，\n拍摄结束后一起怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8202_038chz", "source_sha256": "c643ab4a7983e84de6369018c1d44f6ff163c2623ca0dc40f159300411dd9ce6", "ja": "いいですわね！　お仕事の後に、グイっと\nセレブビールを一杯……ふふ、今日も頑張りましょう♪", "zh": "太棒了！　等工作结束后，再痛快地\n来上一杯名媛啤酒……呵呵，今天也要加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8300_p", "source_sha256": "7e134545293455aa861175ca22d9e5c2ea600a8f3894f224822ce9a26db93c5f", "ja": "実は……バーには一度も行ったことがなくて。\n敷居の高さに尻込みしてしまって。", "zh": "其实……我一次都没去过酒吧。\n总觉得门槛太高，望而却步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8301_038chz", "source_sha256": "aec9c53032e7471a736431c44ac60cde9ce3c078c9784aee2b901875dd3c16fe", "ja": "そうでしたか。{$P$}に\n色々と学ぼうと思ってましたのに……。", "zh": "原来如此。我本来还想着向{$P$}请教各种事情呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_038chz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_038chz_8302_038chz", "source_sha256": "42a1a67114c682060a4fcd54c4322dc8f7f9628ab66249c6500cd98768053336", "ja": "……ハッ！　いつも遅くまで、仕事をしております\nものね。バーに行く暇など……わたくしとしたことが！", "zh": "……啊！您平时总是工作到很晚\n呢。哪会有闲工夫去酒吧……我真是太失策了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
